{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月10日，有報道稱，杭州娃哈哈集團有限公司法定代表人、董事長兼總經理許思敏已辭職。內部人士表示，許思敏還未完全離開公司，接任許思敏的具體人選，娃哈哈內部已有相關討論，仍未最終敲定。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585718.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.136879+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:15:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"bca9ccd1163f8e2b4ffcd8460f49c377f5a81b4c32cd368ddd5487d030ba17af","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}